{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.EmbeddabilityClosure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.EmbeddabilityClosure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.GCD.Basic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.seifert_genus_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.seifert_genus_bound","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L95-L110","doc":"The Seifert genus bound: for T_{m,n} to be a generator,\n(m-1)(n-1) ≤ 2g(Σ₄) = 8.\n\nThe evenness hypothesis `heven` encodes coprimality of `m, n`:\na torus knot `T_{m,n}` requires `gcd(m, n) = 1`, so exactly one of\n`m, n` is even and `(m-1)(n-1)` is even.  Without it the bound is only\n`(m-1)(n-1) ≤ 9` (natural-number division by 2 rounds down), so the\nclean `≤ 2g` statement genuinely needs the parity input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.embeddability_closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.embeddability_closure","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L83-L93","doc":"**Embeddability closure**: every knot in the particle dictionary\nis embeddable in the genus-4 Bring surface fiber, and hence\ndescends to the base manifold via the fibre functor. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:embeddability-closure","label":"thm:embeddability-closure","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.descendants_embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.descendants_embeddable","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L75-L81","doc":"All Skein descendants are embeddable: g(K) ≤ 4 for all derived K. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.generators_embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.generators_embeddable","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L66-L73","doc":"All generators are embeddable: g(T_{m,n}) ≤ 4 for all T in G. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.particleDictionary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.particleDictionary","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L63-L64","doc":"The full particle dictionary: generators ∪ Skein descendants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.skeinDescendants","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.skeinDescendants","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L56-L61","doc":"Skein descendants (hyperbolic knots derived from generators). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.generators","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L44-L54","doc":"Torus knot generators in the particle dictionary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.embeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.embeddable","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L40-L42","doc":"A knot is embeddable in the Bring surface iff g(K) ≤ 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.source","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.source","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Source: generator name or derivation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.isGenerator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.isGenerator","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Whether this is a torus knot generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.genus","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Seifert genus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.name","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.name","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Name/identifier of the knot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.KnotWithGenus","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L28-L38","doc":"A knot type with its Seifert genus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.brings_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.brings_euler","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L25-L26","doc":"Euler characteristic χ(Σ₄) = 2 - 2g = -6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.brings_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.brings_genus","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/embeddability-closure.lean#L22-L23","doc":"The genus of the Bring surface Σ₄. ","signatureChunk":0}]}